GraphoriDraw licenses

Copyright (c) 2026 The Graphori authors

GraphoriDraw has two parts with two licenses: the illustrations (CC BY 4.0) and
the editor's code (MIT). The Graphori brand is not covered by either.


1. Illustrations: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

Applies to the GraphoriDraw illustration library: the illustrations offered in
the editor at graphori.org/draw (bundled in its library.js file).

You may use, adapt and share the illustrations for any purpose, including
papers, theses, posters, slides, teaching material and commercial work, as long
as you give credit. A line in the figure legend or in the acknowledgments is
enough, for example:

    Illustrations: GraphoriDraw (graphori.org/draw), CC BY 4.0.
    Ilustrações: GraphoriDraw (graphori.org/draw), CC BY 4.0.

If you changed an illustration, say so, for example:

    Illustrations adapted from GraphoriDraw (graphori.org/draw), CC BY 4.0.

Shapes, text, arrows and membranes that you draw yourself with the editor's
tools are yours and need no credit. Screenshots and sample sheets of
GraphoriDraw follow the same terms, except for the brand (section 3).

Full license: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/


